      'A remote village on the edge of an ancient forest. But when the moon is full, something old and hungry stirs among its people. Deal the cards and let everyone look at their role in secret.',
      'The village was once a peaceful little place – until one full-moon night, when the first howl rolled across the rooftops. Since then, no one trusts their neighbor. Look at your card and keep silent.',
